ons to suit all budgets. Most of the budget hotels are located at the southern end of the Negombo Beach area in Lewis Place." target="_blank" href="https://www.bing.com/ck/a?!&amp;&amp;p=2e003049c13829a8c7ad79b115c75bf0405cee3d786fa28d86d6fd05f4b0d605JmltdHM9MTc3NTg2NTYwMA&amp;ptn=3&amp;ver=2&amp;hsh=4&amp;fclid=2ef4c5e4-2b7f-6993-331e-d0e82a3a6873&amp;psq=negombo+trevl+pages&amp;u=a1aHR0cHM6Ly93d3cuaG9saWRpZnkuY29tL3BsYWNlcy9uZWdvbWJvLw&amp;ntb=1" h="ID=SERP,5606.1"><div class="df_alsoAskCard landscape rqnafbUlWrapper df_alsoAskAnsCard" data-tag="RelatedQnA.Item" data-query="How do I get to Negombo?" data-iid="SERP.5548" data-parentiid="SERP.5549" id=""><div class="df_qnacontent qnacontent"><div class="df_qntext title df_qnlink">How do I get to Negombo?</div><div class="body" tabindex="0"><p>Getting Around: Tuk-tuk is the most common and popular way of exploring Negombo. Be sure to negotiate the price before the ride. You can also rent a bike. Accommodation: Negombo has accommodations to suit all budgets. Most of the budget hotels are located at the southern end of the Negombo Beach area in Lewis Place.</p></div></div><div class="b_attribution b_clearfix qfavc"><div class="b_imagePair"><div class="cico favicon" style="width:16px;height:16px;"><img src="./negambo_files/ODF.n_jmvnavQkduPbDNmGo3sA" height="16" width="16" data-priority="2" role="presentation" class="rms_img" data-bm="37"></div><div><cite class="url">holidify.com</cite></div></div></div></div></a></div></div><div class="slide wptSld rowSpan4 colSpan3" data-dataurl="" data-rinterval="" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5562.1" data-tag="" style="" tabindex="" data-mini="" role="listitem"><div class="b_wpt_bl colSpan3 rowSpan4 b_wpt_bl_h b_wpt_bl_bord b_wpt_bl_back" data-appns="SERP" data-k="5165" style="cursor: pointer;"><div class="b_wamMagWrapper" data-ds="smrs"><div data-priority="2"><div class="arcimgcolsrw128"><div class="b_aimgSetrcw"><div data-priority="2" class="aimgclgsw1917"><div class="cico b_awrich_i